<changelog>
    <release version="4.3.4" revision="1aeltra1" upstream-version="4.3.4-1"
        maintainer="Tobias Koch" email="tobias.koch@gmail.com"
        date="2026-11-21 01:51:38+03:00">
        <changeset>
            <li>Update to version 4.3.4-1 from Debian forky.</li>
            <li>Built as with Debian's build profile pkg.cmake.bootstrap: with
                the libraries that come with CMake (curl, libarchive, libuv,
                rhash, jsoncpp, cppdap and others) and OpenSSL.</li>
            <li>cmake-data is part of cmake, as in Debian.</li>
            <li>No documentation and no manual pages, they need Sphinx.</li>
        </changeset>
    </release>
